317:**Comparison.** Problems answered exactly, of 20 per cell; in brackets, the number of replies that exhausted the token budget. Qwen3.5-27B is the FP8 release; all other models ran with reasoning at their highest available setting, accessed on 31 October 2026. The errors of GPT-6.1 Sol and Claude Opus 5.5 were completed replies well within the budget, differing from the correct sum in 1 to 637 digits; 9 of the 13 errors of Gemini 4 Argon exhausted the budget. Most errors of the open-weight models exhausted the budget, except those of Gemma 4 31B, 46 of whose 64 errors were incorrect answers in completed replies. Qwen3.5-27B exhausted the budget in 93 of its 99 failures, and Qwen3.5-0.8B with chain of thought in all of its 217.
