| 2 | Which reward-learning mechanisms observations distinguish | 3% | 4 | 12 | 40% |
| 3 | Representation changes in archived category/relational learning | 2% | 4 | 8 | 35% |
| 4 | New human relational-error/rescue experiments | 1% | 5 | 5 | 25% |
| 5 | Discovering a new grammatical restriction | 1% | 5 | 5 | 15% |
| 6 | Memory-based grammatical-cue compensation; word-order universals | 1% | 4 | 4 | 20% |
| 7 | Publish existing Sketchpad/certified arithmetic | 1% | 3 | 3 | 65% |
| 8 | Repair Nerode-inspired training with distinguishing futures | 0.5% | 4 | 2 | 40% |
| 9= | Formal-paper error census | 0.5% | 4 | 2 | 15% |
